OL,3,GNEWSASpalding Flower Parade 2027
OL,4,Acancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe annual Spalding Flower Parade will
OL,7,Fnot go ahead in 2027, organisers have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FIts committee made the decision at a
OL,11,Fmeeting earlier in the week, citing ill
OL,12,Fhealth in the team.
OL,14,FThis year's event was also cancelled,
OL,15,Fwith organisers again stating ill
OL,16,Fhealth as the reason as well as
OL,17,Ffinancial pressures.
OL,19,FCommittee spokesperson Lee Dickins said
OL,20,Fhe hoped the event could go ahead in
OL,21,F2028.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
